OL,3,AAlberta votes overwhelmingly to remain
OL,4,Apart of Canada
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in Alberta have voted
OL,7,Foverwhelmingly to stay in Canada,
OL,8,Frejecting a proposal to pursue
OL,9,Fseparation through a binding
OL,10,Freferendum.
OL,12,FWith most votes counted, more than
OL,13,Ftwo-thirds of voters in the province
OL,14,Fhad chosen to remain part of the
OL,15,Fcountry rather than pushing for
OL,16,Findependence, according to Elections
OL,17,FAlberta.
OL,19,FPrime Minister Mark Carney said on
OL,20,FTuesday that "it's a great result for
OL,21,FCanada" and he is "thrilled that
OL,22,FAlbertans have chosen unity".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
