OL,3,AAlberta votes overwhelmingly to remain
OL,4,Apart of Canada
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe vote was called earlier this year
OL,7,Fby the province's leader, Danielle
OL,8,FSmith, in response to a public
OL,9,Fpetition. Smith herself opposed the
OL,10,Fseparatist push but said the public
OL,11,Fwill for a vote was undeniable.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
